SUMMARY:Contra dance · Carrboro Century Center
LOCATION:Carrboro Century Center\, 100 N Greensboro St\, Carrboro\, NC 2751
 0
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Country Dancers' flagship monthly contra with live mus
 ic and a beginner lesson\; friendly\, all-ages crowd that welcomes newcome
 rs.\n\nBeginner lesson at 7:30. The New Year's Eve dance (Contrazz!\, call
 er Barbara Groh) runs 8pm to midnight\, $18–40.\n\nHow to join: Just sho
 w up\; pay at the door\n\nBefore you go: January and February dates aren't
  posted yet. The hall is about 12 miles from downtown Durham.\n\nhttps://w
 ww.tcdancers.org/new-events\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.tcdancers.org/new-events
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="100 N Greensboro St, Carrb
 oro, NC 27510";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Carrboro Century Center":geo:35.
 91036,-79.0722
END:VEVENT
