BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-swing-dance-20261121@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261118T171736Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T230000
SUMMARY:Swing dance party · Carrboro Century Center
LOCATION:Carrboro Century Center\, 100 N Greensboro St\, Carrboro\, NC 2751
 0
DESCRIPTION:The Triangle Swing Dance Society's monthly live-band swing danc
 e with a free beginner lesson\; no partner needed.\n\nBeginner lesson at 7
 pm (included)\; live band 8–11pm. Optional $5 'Beyond the Basics' lesson
  at 6:45pm at the Carrboro Civic Club.\n\nHow to join: Buy tickets on the 
 Triangle Swing Dance Society website (on sale about 2 weeks before) or at 
 the door\n\nBefore you go: Only Nov 21 is posted so far. Dances are roughl
 y monthly\, often on the 3rd Saturday\, so check for December through Febr
 uary dates.\n\nhttps://triangleswingdancesociety.squarespace.com/events\n\
 nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://triangleswingdancesociety.squarespace.com/events
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="100 N Greensboro St, Carrb
 oro, NC 27510";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Carrboro Century Center":geo:35.
 91036,-79.0722
END:VEVENT
