SUMMARY:Bird walk · Mason Farm Preserve
LOCATION:Mason Farm Biological Preserve (most outings)\, 500 Finley Golf Co
 urse Rd\, Chapel Hill\, NC 27517
DESCRIPTION:Free guided bird walks (formerly New Hope Audubon)\; no reserva
 tions\, all skill levels\, about twice a week in season.\n\nMost walks mee
 t at Mason Farm Biological Preserve\; the Bird Alliance posts each walk's 
 location a day or two ahead.\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; the Bird Allia
 nce posts each walk's location on its website a day or two ahead\n\nBefore
  you go: December to February walks aren't posted yet (it's Christmas Bird
  Count season).\n\nhttps://newhopebirdalliance.org/\n\nListed on Same Time
  Next Week.
URL:https://newhopebirdalliance.org/
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="500 Finley Golf Course Rd,
  Chapel Hill, NC 27517";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Mason Farm Biological P
 reserve (most outings)":geo:35.897414,-79.021992
END:VEVENT
