SUMMARY:Bird walk · Brumley Forest
LOCATION:Brumley Forest Nature Preserve\, north\, 3620 Old State Hwy 10\, N
 C
DESCRIPTION:A free guided bird walk with the New Hope Bird Alliance (former
 ly New Hope Audubon). All skill levels are welcome\, and the walk leaders 
 are glad to help beginners.\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; no reservation 
 needed\n\nBefore you go: The Bird Alliance posts each walk's location a da
 y or two ahead\; check the morning of.\n\nhttps://newhopebirdalliance.org/
 \n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://newhopebirdalliance.org/
END:VEVENT
