UID:d-tree-planting-training-20261115@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261118T171736Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T170000
SUMMARY:Tree planting training · Trees for the Triangle
LOCATION:Trees for the Triangle\, Carrboro\, NC (exact meeting spot on the 
 sign-up listing)
DESCRIPTION:A hands-on afternoon learning to plant trees with a Triangle tr
 ee-planting group. It's outdoor group work with plenty of time to talk.\n\
 nHow to join: Sign up for 'Tree Planting Training in Carrboro 11/15/26' on
  volunteer.activategood.org (search for the title). Spots are limited.\n\n
 Before you go: Confirm the meeting location after you sign up.\n\nhttps://
 volunteer.activategood.org/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://volunteer.activategood.org/
END:VEVENT
